WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Hello everyone!

00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:07.296
Midorijima

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.770
This island is mine!

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:27.670
If you get caught by the Poisonous Robot, you'll be able to destroy the whole island in no time!

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.580
It's great to eat green and draw it on a rock.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:44.350
To everyone in Midorijima

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.700
I'm going to deliver freshly baked bread.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:50.680
Do you want to go with Cheese?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:54.930
I want to see Aoba.

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.080
What? That's what you said.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:58.820
Ehehe.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:02:58.980
Thank you for watching!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.140
It's okay. Let's go together.

00:03:06.172 --> 00:03:10.732
The weather is going to get worse, so it's better to go back early.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:11.440
Yes!

00:03:11.932 --> 00:03:13.632
I'm counting on you.

00:03:13.724 --> 00:03:16.484
Cheese, be careful not to fall over.

00:03:20.028 --> 00:03:21.088
Hey, hey!

00:03:21.148 --> 00:03:23.148
Please be really careful.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.680
Aoba-hime, shall we return to the island of fruits where only delicious fruits are found on Midori Island?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.140
See? It's fresh and fresh.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:56.220
Of course, fruits are fresh and fresh.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.600
Oh, yes. Dakin-chan always makes a loud noise.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.360
Compared to that, Otaku is quiet.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:14.460
Well, it's a little too quiet.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:20.190
It's not just the plant's role to make delicious fruits.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.440
It glitters and lightens the sun.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.990
It suppresses strong winds and rains.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.160
The flowers and the beautiful green make me feel at ease.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.940
Midorijima is an island for all kinds of plants.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.510
It's important.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.460
You can't change the island just for you.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.340
It's so sad!

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.300
You can make it a fruit island without saying anything.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.390
It's like we have to kill it.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:54.980
Okay.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:08.350
I'll reflect on it.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.250
Goodbye.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:10.500
Goodbye.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:18.350
I'll go to Midorijima.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.280
I'll deliver bread to everyone in Midorijima.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.520
I wanted to go there too.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.050
If you go now, I'll go with you.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:31.960
But the weather is...

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.450
I'm fine. Let's go!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:35.330
Oh, be careful.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:50.410
I'm going to buy it.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:56.980
I'm going to beat up Anpanman with a poisonous white robot.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:01.840
Something's not right.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.950
Midorijima has completely changed in color and shape.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.880
Let's hurry!

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:14.010
What's wrong with this place?

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.930
It's full of rocks.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.130
Everyone!

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:41.790
He's crying!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.840
Let me go, let me go, let me go.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.850
My face is already crushed. Why did this happen?

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:35.750
It's Valkyrie Man.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:40.300
Valkyrie Man turned the Green Island into the Island of Iwayama with his poisonous robot.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.110
I see. So it was Valkyrie Man's doing.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.820
The island is completely destroyed. Help!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.980
I have to get out of here somehow.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.480
All right!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:57.870
I can't do anything with my face like this.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.230
If we don't get Jam-Oji-san to make a new face,

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.420
is there any way we can contact the bakery?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.330
We just need to get the letter from Aoba.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:21.440
He said he'll go outside and get the letter from Aoba.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:25.730
Cheese will be fine.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:29.260
He'll get out of between the rocks.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.020
きっとだれかがひろってパンこうじょうにとどけてくれます。

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.790
頼んだよチーズ!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.760
しまじゅう

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.440
I was looking for it.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:09.690
I told you that if you go to Midori Island, there are delicious fruits.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.120
What are you going to do?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:16.360
No, no, no.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.390
Sometimes it's good to change your mood on the island of green.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:23.370
Blue sky, beautiful green.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.510
The air is delicious.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.190
Where is the beautiful green?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.090
I'm sure you'll understand!

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:41.380
I'll make you mine!

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:56.410
It's getting cold...

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.440
The wind is...

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:34.450
What is this?

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:36.790
What is this?

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.420
Isn't this a letter from Aoba?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:51.020
It's the work of Dabaikinman.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.620
Wadako, let's go right away.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:06.820
The new face has burned!

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:08.020
Ah!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:09.570
Let's change!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.670
The wind and tears...

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:24.250
But I'm firmly caught!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.290
No! The waves are rough and won't move forward a bit!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:38.900
Mr. Samoji, I can't reach the new river!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.460
No, Melonpanna-chan! It's this wind!

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:46.050
No, it's okay! Open the hatch!

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:53.030
Okay! I'm counting on you, Melonpanna-chan!

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.500
I won't lose!

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:25.970
How about this, Baikinman?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.270
How about this, Baikinman?

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.690
I'm a good boy.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.170
If you don't cooperate quietly, you won't know what's going to happen.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.020
What are you going to do, Baikinman?

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.160
This is what I'm going to do!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:39.500
Ah!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:55.570
Don't worry, Baikinman!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.510
Shoot it!

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:02.350
In the meantime...

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.010
It's time for you to become a baby.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:07.730
Look.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.160
There it is.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.020
Then...

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:25.450
When did you...

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.870
I won't forgive you for doing such a terrible thing, Viking Man!

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:29.610
No, no, no, no.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.100
Actually, Dokin-chan is...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:36.460
I got this.

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:38.240
See?

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.760
W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W...

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.620
I-I'm really sorry, Anpanman!

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:43.500
I'll say this honestly.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:44.900
Huh?

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.230
There's no way I'll say that!

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:49.030
See?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:54.790
I'll give you a special treat!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:56.010
No!

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.650
That face...

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:58.630
I can't take that rock!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.600
Let's go! Prepare yourself!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:00.990
Let's go, Baikinman!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.640
Where are you going?

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:06.240
Melonpacher!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.360
We're going to split up and fight!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:19.330
You can't take it!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:08.590
What the fuck?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.720
So, so, so, so!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.100
We need to get out of here!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.000
Go on, go!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:15.220
Ah!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:26.690
Little A!

00:18:26.588 --> 00:18:27.588
With my power...

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.060
Everyone, are you okay?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.740
It's really...

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.580
Roll...

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.020
Huh?

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:43.540
Oh...

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:47.390
Sister...

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:49.320
Uh...

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.640
That's...

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.360
That's...

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:01.410
You

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:33.830
Melonpanna

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.810
I'm glad. It's okay now.

00:20:00.988 --> 00:20:02.588
I'm glad, everyone.

00:20:03.868 --> 00:20:05.108
But the island...

00:20:05.404 --> 00:20:06.464
Leave it to me!

00:20:06.652 --> 00:20:08.652
Thank you for watching!

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:39.760
It's so beautiful. The green is so bright.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.470
What about Midori-jima?

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:44.930
Right.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:55.010
That's ridiculous.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:30.710
See you next time.
